          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yami Yehova Nzambi yenu nayifumishili mwituŋa daEjipitu kulonda niikali Nzambi yenu. Yami Yehova Nzambi yenu.",
          "type": "text",
